    "A": "\\(\\angle 1=\\angle 2\\)",
    "B": "\\(\\angle 1\\) and \\(\\angle 2\\) are vertically opposite angles",
    "C": "Vertically opposite angles are supplementary",
    "D": "\\(\\angle 1\\) and \\(\\angle 2\\) are equal"
  },
  "Correct Answer": "B",
  "Accepted Answers": [],
  "Unordered Answers": false,
  "Solution": "The condition (hypothesis) of the proposition is written under “Given”: \\(\\angle 1\\) and \\(\\angle 2\\) are vertically opposite angles. The conclusion is written under “To prove”: \\(\\angle 1=\\angle 2\\).",
